```text
Start
	|
	v
Capture Image
	|
	v
Preprocess Image
	|
	v
Detect Number Plate
	|
	v
Crop Plate Region
	|
	v
Segment Characters
	|
	v
Recognize Characters
	|
	v
Assemble Plate String
	|
	v
Store / Display Result
	|
	v
End
```

Focus on robustness to handwriting variability; consider data augmentation and transfer learning from pretrained OCR models.

Workflow
--------

```text
CAMERA ----> CAPTURE -> PREPROCESSING -> ISOLATE DIGITS -> LEARN -> TRAIN DATA -> OCR -> PLAUSI -> DATABASE
			^      |                                 |                             ^
			|      V                                 |_____________________________|
		IMAGE <--SAVE IMAGE
     DIRECTORY        
```


